  "description": "Rengar's Unseen Predator from the map's bushes (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Rengar so his next attack is the leap whenever he stands in a bush, read from the map, or in Ivern's brush (with Ivern's add-on); in a fight the bush's leap is lost again once he walks out. The main pack's readiness all stays: on respawn, after 3 s without acting (out of combat a bush's leap stays too) and after R, so a fight he walks into opens with a leap. A swing at a tower or the nexus is a plain one and keeps the leap for the next unit (League's leap never goes at turrets). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-07",
  "mod_id": "league_rengar_bush",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Rengar's leap from the bushes (test)",
  "version": "0.2.2"
}
